 "text": "Hi, how are you today? autumn is lovely, the leaves changing give it special every day. If you want surprise, honeymoon before guests come is unbeatable. Sure, take your time. Do you know who else lives there? And has anyone moved out? Call your landlord or the previous tenant, they can tell you for sure. An hour or two is fine, a full day gives boredom space to creep in. Sure, still some of what's new since you were in. In France, the ATM fees. Good idea, you' meet people there anyway. Welcome back. We' still going for the autumn. The honeymoon is still special the day after the wedding. Start late afternoon, so you see the sun going down somewhere you've never met before. Nice way to end the honeymoon.",
